# env.optional — precision enrichment only; the serp-derived report is complete without these.
#
# Measured authority/traffic/ranked-keywords/backlinks via scripts/paid_seo.py (DataForSEO,
# HTTP Basic auth). When set, the estimate labels upgrade to "measured"; absent -> serp-
# derived estimates (the adapter exits gracefully, the keyless profile still ships):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
# Semrush/Ahrefs public-page scraper actors for precise authority/traffic/backlink numbers:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Bring-your-own paid SEO API (NO Robomotion package, alternative to DataForSEO; not wired
# into paid_seo.py — call via curl) for highest precision:
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_KEY
# Bring-your-own-key summary synthesis instead of platform-default model (usually unset):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
